  }))), "TrOCR"), mdx("p", null, "TrOCR is a powerful state-of-the-art model for text recognition from images using HuggingFace Transformers.\nThe TrOCR pipeline includes a vision transformer (ViT) and a BERT-based model. Estad et al. acknowledge that the technology is newer and has not been widely used for low-resource languages, but when used on non-low-resource languages, it generally outperforms Tesseract and Transkribus. However, it doesn\u2019t perform well in layout analysis and can only read single lines of text at a time, not entire PDFs. For that, you\u2019ll need other packages and pipelines as described in this ", mdx("a", {
